WEBVTT

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.970
Transform!

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:06.940
Toh!

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.770
Ta-dah!

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.490
Time to be Mana's little helper!

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:15.530
Me too!

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.230
Thanks for the help, Charles.

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:23.800
And Rachel, I'm grateful for the consideration,

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:27.860
but having an elementary schooler in a middle school's kinda, well...

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:32.750
But I want to help you, Rikka!

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.020
Thump!

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:35.550
Thump!

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.230
I'm jealous, Charles...

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.530
President, Rikka, I need help!

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.470
Oh... what's wrong, Yashima?

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:45.980
My Pom-Pom...

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:49.730
My Pom-Pom's gone missing...

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:52.730
Pom... poms? {Rikka says "pom-poms" here, to show she doesn't know the discussion is about a rabbit.}

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:56.310
He looks like he has two tails, right?

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:58.360
Oh, hence the name.

00:00:58.360 --> 00:00:59.010
Yes.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:02.740
But because of that, he doesn't have many rabbit friends.

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:06.020
So I've been supporting him every day.

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:08.590
But now this...

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:10.280
Oh, Pom-Pom!

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:12.820
There's no need to cry!

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:14.920
We'll help you find him!

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:16.590
Charles is on the case, too!

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:21.030
Thank you all so much!

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:26.620
<i>All right, I'm doing this!</i>

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:33.220
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:35.690
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:38.540
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:40.570
Every day it sparkles

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:44.240
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:51.170
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:56.830
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:02.470
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:07.900
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:13.610
If your friends are in trouble

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:22.490
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:24.160
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.560
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:29.410
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:32.200
What's more than just cute

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.070
is our promise between girls

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:42.120
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:48.010
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:54.390
Pom-Pom!

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:55.990
Pom-Pom!

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.090
Pom-Pom, where are you?

00:02:58.090 --> 00:02:59.960
Come out wherever you are!

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:01.830
Found him?

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:03.110
Nope.

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:06.800
Where did he run off to?

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:11.760
I don't know what I'll do if I can't find him!

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:14.840
Hey!

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:18.340
I found him! I found Pom-Pom!

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:18.950
Rachel!

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:20.330
Pom-Pom!

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:27.850
I was so worried!

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:28.860
Where were you?

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:31.930
Thank goodness you found him.

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:34.350
Rachel, you saved the day!

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.320
Way to go!

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:38.730
Thank you so much!

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:40.490
Huh?

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:42.170
Rachel, was it?

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:42.710
Yeah!

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:46.680
Oh Rachel, you're my hero!

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:50.480
Hero?

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:51.710
Yeah!

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:06.190
Rachel's on Cloud Nine!

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:06.190
Rachel's on Cloud Nine!

00:04:13.590 --> 00:04:17.640
I can't get Yashima's smile out of my head!

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:24.740
Huh?

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.320
What's this?

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:29.500
My heart's racing for some reason!

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:32.120
Am I coming down with something?!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.150
This is bad! I gotta sleep!

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:40.320
Keep it down, will ya...

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:44.770
Your heart won't stop racing?

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:46.970
No, it won't...

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.930
Oh yeah, your face's been pretty red, too.

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:53.630
Do you have a fever?

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:54.990
Does he?

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:56.670
It burns!

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:00.340
Perhaps it's a cold?

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:02.500
Fairies can catch colds?

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:04.840
I've never seen one that did.

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:07.460
What else could cause it?

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:10.610
My chest is also all knotted up...

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:12.590
It hurts!

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.900
Maybe it really is a cold?

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:17.870
Not quite.

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:22.500
It must be lovesickness.

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.570
Lovesickness?

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:29.010
Rachel fell in love with that pet caretaker!

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:30.280
Huh?

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:33.850
Love? You mean...

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:36.540
H-Huh?

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:38.260
What is it?

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.780
That's what we wanna ask!

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:43.540
Are you really in love?

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:45.060
With Yashima?

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:47.790
Yashimaaa...

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.400
Ehehe...

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:53.040
It seems...

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.370
there's little room for doubt.

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:58.110
Meaning there's room for grave concern.

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:00.900
A fairy is in love with a human!

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:02.110
That's right!

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:04.420
We need to nip this in the bud, and fast!

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:07.280
You mean...

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:09.900
You want us to break them up?!

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:11.730
That's too much for our hearts to bear!

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:13.190
Hey, listen,

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:16.070
it's not like they're going out already...

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:18.130
Rachel, I won't hear any excuses.

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:19.560
You must let—

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:25.760
What's the big idea?!

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:27.760
Love is love! {I can't really fit anything in that captures the nuance of an institution that forces idols to give up on romance, so I'll just call Rachel gay.}

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:30.720
This is for Rachel's own good!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:32.080
Calm down.

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:34.030
You're both acting like children.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:35.830
Objection!

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.250
Makoto, whose side are you on?!

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:41.890
Get back here!

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:44.720
Forcing moral dilemmas on Makoto is <i>not</i> okay!

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:46.830
Calm down, everyone!

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:48.120
Look, Yashima isn't e—

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:49.700
Yashimaaaa...

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:56.450
Yesterday, she said she'd be on duty, so I could come over to hang out!

00:06:56.450 --> 00:07:00.020
Now, if you'll excuse me...

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:07.930
Yashima!

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:11.230
I'll help you clean the cages.

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:14.020
Rachel, you really came.

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:15.850
Thank you.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:28.060
Can he handle this?

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:29.990
Handle what?

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:36.600
Rachel's the honest, overthinking type.

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:41.170
If he's really in love with Yashima, I can't help but worry...

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:44.370
Indeed, it's worrying!

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:46.180
He'll be fine!

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:50.520
The one he really loves is Rikka, after all!

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:53.890
I feel the same.

00:07:58.540 --> 00:07:59.400
Done!

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:01.370
It's all clean.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:03.630
Rachel, thanks for cleani—

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:04.700
Yashima!

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:09.740
A bee?

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:13.440
Yeah, it was about to hit your head.

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:16.360
You saved me again.

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:19.180
Rachel, you really are my hero.

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:23.160
<i>It's racing again...</i>

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:27.710
<i>Why does it beat so fast when Yashima smiles?</i>

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:32.830
It must be lovesickness.

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:37.120
Something wrong?

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.150
N-Not a nothing! {intentional}

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:42.500
Well, let's go home, then.

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:43.270
Huh?

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:51.880
<i>But I don't want to leave yet...</i>

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:57.700
<i>Let's stay just a bit longer...</i>

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:01.460
Yashima!

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:18.840
What is it?

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:25.590
I want to spend another hour, or even just a half,

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:28.460
with you...

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:33.890
Then I'll show you my favorite spot.

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:39.950
<i>I see...</i>

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:41.420
<i>I get it now!</i>

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:44.230
<i>I really am...</i>

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:49.070
<i>in love with Yashima!</i>

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:00.500
Ugh.

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:03.260
Nothing but lovebirds as far as the eye can see.

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:05.060
Hmph. Too much free time.

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:08.410
That's rich, coming from you.

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:12.230
Are you in any position to say that?

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:13.630
Ooh, I'm shakin'!

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:15.600
Oh, there's a thought.

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:18.820
Without me around, you two look like lovebirds yourselves!

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:19.900
Have fun!

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:22.340
Lovebirds?!

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:25.120
Okay, I'm done here.

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:28.000
I think I'll go make some Precure lives hell.

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:36.750
But still...

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:39.940
what relation does that Kyupirappa have with Egogy?

00:10:41.170 --> 00:10:42.490
It's curious...

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:09.780
<i>It's like we're on a date!</i>

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:11.300
<i>My heart's pounding!</i>

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:14.520
Rachel, are you not feeling well?

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:16.290
No, I'm fine!

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.990
I'm thrilled to be on this boat!

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:20.990
Oh, that's good.

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:25.000
I love this lake, myself.

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:28.270
Isn't the water so clean and beautiful?

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.790
<i>She sure is...</i>

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:41.940
You know, this lake is cleaned by a lot of volunteers,

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:45.850
and now it's so clean that even birds flock here!

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:47.550
Wow!

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:49.810
I want to help!

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:52.560
Thanks, Rachel.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:59.150
So, what do you normally do, Rachel?

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:02.170
Battle the forces of evil with my comrades!

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:04.550
Oh, like role-playing?

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:07.970
It's not role-playing!

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:10.390
I know, I know.

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:13.880
All kids take their games seriously.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:17.690
<i>That's not quite it, but oh well.</i>

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:21.140
Where do you live? What do you like?

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:24.290
Umm... oh, the Hundred Poets! {herkz pls check I haven't seen chihayafull in forever}

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:26.300
Really? Wow!

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:27.870
What's your favorite poem?

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:29.970
Huh? Um...

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:31.950
Um...

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:34.270
This one!

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:41.280
For your precious sake, once my eager life itself was not dear to me.

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:44.840
But now it is my heart's desire that I live forever.

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:45.770
I know that one!

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:47.250
It's a poem of love.

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:51.450
<i>I just happened to remember it!</i>

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.270
<i>It was a love poem?</i>

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:56.130
<i>There's no denying it anymore!</i>

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:58.220
<i>I'm in love with Yashima!</i>

00:12:58.220 --> 00:12:59.260
Something wrong?

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:01.500
N-Not a nothing!

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:04.020
So Yashima, what kind of music do you like?

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:11.310
You think you're all so happy with your dumb boats?

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:13.740
This lake could rot for all I care.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:19.480
I'm just venting...

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:25.630
Why not let this lake rot?

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:29.470
I'll turn your desire into a dream come true.

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:29.880
I'll turn your desire into a dream come true.

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:30.340
I'll turn your desire into a dream come true.

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:30.860
I'll turn your desire into a dream come true.

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:34.900
Go berserk!

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:37.930
Release the darkness in your heart!

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:45.790
Flush!

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.210
What's that?

00:13:50.650 --> 00:13:52.390
A dark heartbeat!

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:55.280
I heard it from the park!

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:57.530
Rachel!

00:13:59.510 --> 00:14:01.290
Potty shower!

00:14:03.890 --> 00:14:05.260
That is <i>so</i> gross!

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:07.230
That potty's spraying something funky!

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:08.990
No way in hell!

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:12.490
Shower!

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:14.880
Just like that.

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:19.610
Tear those couples and their pretty lake apart!

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:22.640
Why is this happening?

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:24.590
It's polluting the lake!

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:25.480
How horrible!

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:30.150
Then I'll protect this lake for you!

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:31.960
Rachel?

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:34.930
Yashima, wait there! I'm going!

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:35.920
Wait, Rachel!

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:37.630
This isn't a game!

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:39.460
<i>I know...</i>

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:41.600
<i>But I'm serious!</i>

00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:45.700
Girls! A Selfish appeared!

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:48.440
Yeah, we're on our way to the park!

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:52.010
Girls, hurry!

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:53.270
This way!

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:56.650
We've gotta fight for Yashima!

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:58.560
He's really into it.

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:00.580
The power of love, I suppose.

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:03.380
All right girls, let's go!

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:04.940
Rachel!

00:15:06.070 --> 00:15:08.860
Precure Love Link!

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:09.590
L-O-V-E!

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:10.340
L-O-V-E!

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:11.020
L-O-V-E!

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:12.170
L-O-V-E!

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:16.060
Precure Dress Up!

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:18.150
Kyupirappa!

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:39.590
Brimming with love,

00:15:39.590 --> 00:15:41.150
Cure Heart!

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:45.580
The light of wisdom,

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:47.910
Cure Diamond!

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:51.910
The warmth of the sun,

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:54.350
Cure Rosetta!

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:57.020
The blade of courage,

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:59.020
Cure Sword!

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:03.850
Love's trump card,

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:05.240
Cure Ace!

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:09.820
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:12.060
Dokidoki Precure!

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:18.090
Didn't they save us during the cultural festival?

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:20.800
Oh poor duck who has lost its love,

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:22.960
I, Cure Heart,

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:26.500
will make your heart race once more!

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:30.270
Oh no, this is no duck! It's a potty!

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:32.570
Hyper Potty Shower!

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:34.540
Beware!

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:36.040
That shower is poison!

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:45.410
Wait, wait!

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:46.590
Rachel?

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:49.560
Yashima loves this lake!

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:52.030
So I won't let that thing hurt it!

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:54.500
When you put it like that...

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:58.390
I'll fight shower with shower!

00:16:58.390 --> 00:16:59.530
Darn right!

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:03.630
Precure Diamond Shower!

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:14.180
I only pretended to be a potty!

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.450
Duck Feather Shower!

00:17:17.420 --> 00:17:18.910
Thank you!

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:20.260
Think nothing of it!

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:22.220
Hyper Shower Shower!

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:25.900
No, not again!

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:40.840
How dare you!

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.480
Diamond Swirk—

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:44.950
Diamond Swirk—

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.430
You stupid potty!

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:48.810
Don't pollute the lake!

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:50.360
Rachel!

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:53.870
We're ramming him head on!

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:55.670
No, wait, Rachel, calm do—

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:58.150
I'm gonna protect this lake!

00:17:58.150 --> 00:18:02.700
I promised Yashima I would!

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:10.060
Rachel, for real, stop!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:10.710
I am...

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:14.680
Yashima's hero!

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:19.350
Seeeeeelf!

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:30.590
Pssssssss...

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:36.030
I suppose... we should purify it.

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:52.210
We send our power to you, Cure Heart!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:05.830
Precure Lovely Straight Flush!

00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:17.780
Love love looooove!

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:32.370
What was <i>that</i>?

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:33.020
Hmph!

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:37.160
Yashima!

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:40.070
The lake returned to normal!

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:40.860
Yeah!

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:45.290
Because you protected it, right?

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:45.830
Yeah!

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:51.050
This is that Rachel boy I was telling you about.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:54.150
He said he wanted to volunteer too!

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:56.010
Who's this?

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:59.430
My boyfriend, Harada. {(ﾉ `Д´)ﾉ ﾐ┻━┻)ﾟДﾟ)彡☆}

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:01.480
Nice to meet you, Rachel.

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:06.470
Bo... y.... frie... nd?

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:12.990
Um... Rachel?

00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:14.640
We ought to get going...

00:20:16.470 --> 00:20:17.670
Rikka!

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:21.070
Sorry for keeping Rachel from you for so long.

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:22.140
Don't worry.

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:24.080
He had fun, right?

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:27.000
Y-Yeah...

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:30.810
Well, see you later, Yashima.

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:31.630
Sure.

00:20:32.740 --> 00:20:35.110
See you later too, Rachel!

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:38.790
S-See ya!

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:49.230
His face is really swollen.

00:20:49.230 --> 00:20:50.930
Should we bring more ice?

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:58.430
I'm sure that it's not his face that's in pain, but his heart.

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:01.510
I-I'm fine.

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:03.450
I protected the lake.

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:10.450
Your fighting out there was magnificent!

00:21:15.130 --> 00:21:17.380
You were heroic, Rachel.

00:21:18.180 --> 00:21:20.860
Your bravery was remarkable.

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:22.120
And you were strong.

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:24.260
Love makes us stronger.

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:26.630
I've learned something today!

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:35.120
Cheer up.

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:37.010
You've got me with you.

00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:41.970
Right?

00:21:46.260 --> 00:21:49.940
You know you're my number one, Rikka!

00:22:00.190 --> 00:22:02.060
Rikka!

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:05.550
{ED}

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:10.040
Ai won't eat her carrots!

00:22:10.040 --> 00:22:13.280
She can't become a healthy adult if she's a picky eater!

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:14.280
Hold on.

00:22:14.280 --> 00:22:17.110
Aguri, you've left nothing but carrots on your plate.

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:19.380
I left them on purpose!

00:22:19.380 --> 00:22:21.250
Wait, do you hate carrots?

00:22:21.250 --> 00:22:22.020
All right!

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:25.560
I, Cure Heart, will end your dislike of carrots once more!

00:22:27.230 --> 00:22:28.730
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.730 --> 00:22:31.800
No More Picky Eating!

00:22:28.730 --> 00:22:31.800
No More Picky Eating!

00:22:32.130 --> 00:22:33.660
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
